      "source": "When all of the requested bytes that can be provided have been loaded—including the possible [`contentInformationRequest`](avassetresourceloadingrequest/contentinformationrequest.md) data in the [`AVAssetResourceLoadingRequest`](avassetresourceloadingrequest.md) instance that contains the receiver—the delegate should respond by invoking [`finishLoading()`](avassetresourceloadingrequest/finishloading().md).",
